{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"files\":[{\"content\":\"#include <algorithm>\\n#include <cstdint>\\n#include <iostream>\\n#include <vector>\\n\\nusing namespace std;\\n\\nconst int MOD = 1000000007;\\n\\nint main() {\\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\\n\\n    int n, m;\\n    if (!(cin >> n >> m)) return 0;\\n\\n    vector<uint64_t> blockedCells;\\n    blockedCells.reserve(static_cast<size_t>(m));\\n    for (int c = 0; c < m; ++c) {\\n        int row, column;\\n        cin >> row >> column;\\n        blockedCells.push_back(static_cast<uint64_t>(row) * static_cast<uint64_t>(n) +\\n                               static_cast<uint64_t>(column));\\n    }\\n    sort(blockedCells.begin(), blockedCells.end());\\n    blockedCells.erase(unique(blockedCells.begin(), blockedCells.end()), blockedCells.end());\\n\\n    vector<int> dp(n, 0);\\n    dp[0] = 1;\\n\\n    size_t blockedIndex = 0;\\n    uint64_t linearIndex = 0;\\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\\n        for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j, ++linearIndex) {\\n            if (blockedIndex < blockedCells.size() && blockedCells[blockedIndex] == linearIndex) {\\n                dp[j] = 0;\\n                ++blockedIndex;\\n            } else if (j != 0) {\\n                int sum = dp[j] + dp[j - 1];\\n                if (sum >= MOD) sum -= MOD;\\n                dp[j] = sum;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    cout << dp[n - 1] << '\\\\n';\\n    return 0;\\n}\\n\",\"path\":\"src/solution.cpp\"}],\"hypothesis\":\"An in-place rolling DP and sorted sparse obstacle indices reduce storage to O(N+M) and eliminate the row-copy pass while preserving the recurrence. The column update has a genuine left-to-right dependency, so it remains scalar rather than being incorrectly marked SIMD.\",\"notes\":\"No execution performed. The dense traversal remains O(N^2); duplicate obstacle coordinates are deduplicated, and blocked endpoints are handled by the recurrence.\",\"research\":{\"queries\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"sources_kept\":[],\"transformations\":[\"Replace the N-by-N blocked-cell matrix with sorted, deduplicated row-major obstacle indices.\",\"Update one DP row in place, preserving the top-cell and left-cell dependency and removing the second-row copy.\",\"Replace modulo division in each update with a conditional subtraction; sums remain within signed int range.\"]}"}}
